# Build-context excludes for api.Dockerfile.
#
# Named `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` rather than dropped into `backend/` as a plain
# `.dockerignore`: BuildKit looks for a per-Dockerfile ignore file next to the
# Dockerfile first, which keeps this file inside the surface that owns it.
#
# The exclusions matter. A host-side `dotnet build` leaves obj/project.assets.json
# holding absolute host paths; copied into the image, it makes the container restore
# fail in a way that reads as a dependency problem.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
